        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left scrotal/testicular pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Gradual onset over 3–4 days, worse over the last 24 hours; left greater than right dull ache with intermittent sharp twinges. Worse standing or walking and at the end of the work day; improved by lying down and tight briefs/scrotal support, but not completely relieved. Pain reported as approximately 5–6/10."
      }
    },
    {
